  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "もえる　からだで　あいてに　ぶつかって\nこうげきする。　じぶんが　あいてより\nおもいほど　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "불타는 몸으로 상대에게 부딪쳐서\n공격한다. 자신이 상대보다\n무거울수록 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用燃燒的身體重壓對手\n進行攻擊。體重比對手\n重越多，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur projette son corps enflammé contre l’ennemi.\nS’il est plus lourd que l’ennemi, l’effet augmente\nen conséquence.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rempelattacke mit brennendem Körper. Je schwerer\nder Anwender im Vergleich zum Ziel ist, desto stärker\ndie Attacke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario ataca con su cuerpo ardiente. Cuanto mayor\nsea su peso comparado con el del objetivo, más daño\ncausará.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa carica con il suo corpo rovente. Più è\npesante rispetto al bersaglio, più danni causa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user slams its target with its flame-covered\nbody. The more the user outweighs the target, the\ngreater the move’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "燃える　体で　相手に　ぶつかって\n攻撃する。　自分が　相手より\n重いほど　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用燃烧的身体\n撞向对手进行攻击。\n自己比对手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario ataca con su cuerpo ardiente. Cuanto mayor\nsea su peso comparado con el del objetivo, más daño\ncausará.",
      "version_group": {
